WEBVTT

00:02:18.860 --> 00:02:20.160
What a horrible dream...

00:02:25.790 --> 00:02:28.750
To ally with devils...

00:02:37.760 --> 00:02:42.390
You have a wonderful singing voice.
It's as if my heart was being purified.

00:02:42.390 --> 00:02:43.890
No, that can't...

00:02:43.890 --> 00:02:47.220
Why not take proper singing lessons?

00:02:47.220 --> 00:02:50.730
The Harvenheit family
will support you completely.

00:02:50.730 --> 00:02:52.150
Really?

00:02:53.110 --> 00:02:54.610
That's very generous of you.

00:02:54.610 --> 00:02:59.860
Nurturing excellent
artists is our work as well.

00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:01.820
Let us take care of
the arrangements right away.

00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:07.700
Thank you very much!
I will do my absolute best!

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:09.250
Here you are, Rosette.

00:03:09.250 --> 00:03:10.540
Tha...

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:16.880
What's wrong?

00:03:16.880 --> 00:03:18.550
I think I'll hold off after all.

00:03:18.550 --> 00:03:19.550
Rosette?

00:03:19.550 --> 00:03:21.180
Are you feeling unwell?

00:03:21.180 --> 00:03:22.800
T-That's not it.

00:03:22.800 --> 00:03:26.180
Or more like, can't I hold off on something
without you jumping to that conclusion?!

00:03:26.810 --> 00:03:28.350
No, you see,

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:32.900
since I've been constantly eating
the splendid food here, I've gotten fat.

00:03:32.900 --> 00:03:34.310
Wouldn't it be embarrassing if,

00:03:34.310 --> 00:03:37.110
in the middle of a fight, the slit
on my skirt just popped right open?

00:03:38.110 --> 00:03:39.490
Oh, Rosette...

00:03:39.490 --> 00:03:41.700
We've gotten more fighting power too,

00:03:41.700 --> 00:03:43.320
and the real battles
are from here on after all!

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:45.070
You certainly are easygoing.

00:03:45.070 --> 00:03:46.370
Satella...

00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:50.500
Thanks to that, I've had the worst dreams,
and I haven't gotten any sleep at all.

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:52.580
Are you awake, Milady?

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:53.960
Good morning.

00:03:56.040 --> 00:03:59.800
It's rather soon,
but it seems that this has...

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:01.170
Another disappearance?

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:03.510
Yes, there have been many recently

00:04:03.510 --> 00:04:04.390
I'm going.

00:04:04.390 --> 00:04:05.390
What, already?

00:04:05.390 --> 00:04:09.060
You just said that you hadn't
gotten any sleep. Aren't you tired?

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:12.020
Don't worry about me. I'm in a hurry!

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:15.600
If I'm going to ally
with devils, then I'd rather collapse.

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:22.240
In any case,
I'm going to do things my way!

00:04:22.240 --> 00:04:24.490
I'm sure it won't be much,
but be sure to do your very best.

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:31.790
I'm very sorry.
Milady definitely did not have any ill will.

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:33.250
We know.

00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:42.840
It looks like group one and group
four don't have enough firepower.

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:45.130
Okay! I'll go to group one!

00:04:45.130 --> 00:04:47.140
Then I'll go to group four.

00:04:48.300 --> 00:04:50.810
Oww! I'm sorry...

00:04:51.470 --> 00:04:56.230
Oh my, that's no good.
You need to watch where you're walking.

00:04:56.230 --> 00:04:59.230
I might just inadvertently eat you up!

00:04:59.230 --> 00:05:01.070
Thank you for your hard work!

00:05:01.070 --> 00:05:01.980
Be well!

00:05:01.980 --> 00:05:03.650
We'll be careful from here on!

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:09.660
Allying with humans ain't so bad!

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:12.160
I can have my pick!

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:17.460
Duffau ordered us to disguise
ourselves as humans here, right?

00:05:17.460 --> 00:05:20.290
Don't be so straight-laced, Gurio.

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:21.500
Right?

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:25.930
Even if we're allying,
our mutual differences are great.

00:05:27.220 --> 00:05:31.930
It would be best for human opponents
to be fought by their fellow humans, right?

00:05:31.930 --> 00:05:33.390
What do you mean?

00:05:33.390 --> 00:05:35.350
In regards to the next battle,

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:39.400
we want to reduce the Sinners'
fighting strength, even if only a little.

00:05:40.310 --> 00:05:41.570
For that purpose...

00:05:41.570 --> 00:05:45.280
We need to cut off
the source of their power.

00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:46.950
The source of their power...

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:50.120
Hey, would you cut that out?

00:05:50.120 --> 00:05:51.620
It really bothers me!

00:05:51.620 --> 00:05:54.540
This pain is pleasant, but...

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:59.330
Do you know of the great number
of disappearance cases in Denver?

00:05:59.330 --> 00:06:03.630
Yes, I've heard that there have been a rash
of disappearances, even in the 'Cisco vicinity.

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:06.220
That very thing is
the source of their power.

00:06:06.220 --> 00:06:10.390
An inexhaustible supply of energy that is
being gathered with a human's assistance.

00:06:10.390 --> 00:06:11.760
A human's assistance?

00:06:12.810 --> 00:06:14.140
Devil worship?

00:06:14.680 --> 00:06:16.310
You say that devil-worshipping ceremonies

00:06:16.310 --> 00:06:19.730
were being held in
the remains of the gold mine?

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:22.230
When we realized it, the youth of the town,

00:06:22.230 --> 00:06:25.610
and the women and
children were all ensnared by it.

00:06:25.610 --> 00:06:27.190
None of them have come back.

00:06:27.190 --> 00:06:29.240
Neither have the guys
who went to bring them back.

00:06:29.240 --> 00:06:32.740
There are even folks who have seen devils
wandering about in the middle of the night.

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:36.580
They really have
made contracts with devils!

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:39.830
Please, save them!

00:07:39.640 --> 00:07:41.140
Is someone there?

00:07:57.530 --> 00:08:00.410
These are the believers who disappeared?

00:08:00.410 --> 00:08:02.040
It couldn't be...

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:04.250
Their spiritual power was drained?

00:08:06.460 --> 00:08:08.920
The holy crucifix...

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:14.890
...it drains and gathers all energy.

00:08:15.640 --> 00:08:18.890
Welcome. It's been
a long time since we had a visitor.

00:08:18.890 --> 00:08:20.600
I welcome you.

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:24.600
I don't want to use violence against
a flesh and blood human opponent.

00:08:24.600 --> 00:08:26.110
Stay still!

00:08:26.110 --> 00:08:30.110
I see. You're a jewel summoner.

00:08:30.110 --> 00:08:32.740
How kind of you. But it's no use.

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:39.580
The jewels...

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:52.210
Eliza Brown,

00:08:52.210 --> 00:08:55.680
born in Denver to a poor miner's family.

00:08:55.680 --> 00:08:58.640
Her marriage at sixteen was a failure.

00:08:58.640 --> 00:09:00.510
She devoted herself to devil worship,

00:09:00.510 --> 00:09:03.640
and wandered around
the country, gathering believers.

00:09:03.640 --> 00:09:06.980
So all of those people didn't disappear.

00:09:06.980 --> 00:09:09.690
More than likely,
they've been made into sacrifices.

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:14.150
Because devils function by making the
very life power of humans their nourishment.

00:09:14.150 --> 00:09:17.360
But they're fellow humans, so why?

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:19.490
That is the true nature of man.

00:09:19.490 --> 00:09:22.740
They are greedy, proud, and selfish.

00:09:22.740 --> 00:09:27.330
In order to satisfy their own desires,
they will calmly sacrifice others.

00:09:27.330 --> 00:09:29.960
They have no problem
selling someone out to a devil.

00:09:30.710 --> 00:09:34.340
I thought that you understood that well.

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:37.590
Right, servant of Fatima?

00:09:37.590 --> 00:09:39.260
You've also come this far with that power

00:09:39.260 --> 00:09:41.600
having been used for
the sake of a personal interest.

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:43.680
Well, that can't be helped.

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:48.150
Your power probably equals
that of several people combined.

00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:50.310
A hundred... No, a thousand!

00:09:50.310 --> 00:09:55.240
Enough to be coveted by
humans and demons alike!

00:09:56.610 --> 00:09:59.110
Az, leave the room now.

00:09:59.110 --> 00:10:00.570
B-But...

00:10:00.570 --> 00:10:05.040
In that state, you're in no condition
to work or even protect yourself.

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:07.210
Rest until you've calmed down.

00:10:07.210 --> 00:10:08.000
Okay.

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:09.710
Now, let's go.

00:10:14.880 --> 00:10:16.170
So in short,

00:10:16.170 --> 00:10:19.720
you're saying that humans should
take care of another human's misconduct?

00:10:19.720 --> 00:10:21.470
You could say that.

00:10:21.470 --> 00:10:25.470
Let me just say that we
have nothing to do with it this time.

00:10:25.470 --> 00:10:29.810
There's no doubt that you should
consider this the work of the Sinners.

00:10:47.580 --> 00:10:50.960
Even if you do this,
nothing will come of it!

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:53.250
How about saying something?!

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:56.460
Getting everyone
involved in this... Killing them...

00:10:56.460 --> 00:10:58.510
Would you snap out of it already?!

00:10:59.760 --> 00:11:04.350
You will also
understand when you meet him.

00:11:04.350 --> 00:11:06.560
He is wonderful.

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:10.770
He is the only one who sees my worth.

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:13.360
He is my everything!

00:11:13.360 --> 00:11:17.280
I'm certain that your power will please him.

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:18.900
Feel honored!

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:20.950
Who would be honored?

00:11:20.950 --> 00:11:23.660
Now give up your spiritual power!

00:11:25.330 --> 00:11:28.750
You are a pitiful woman,
to not understand this joy.

00:11:29.910 --> 00:11:34.960
But of course,
I am the only one that can serve him.

00:11:35.630 --> 00:11:37.960
Because I am the only one!

00:11:42.300 --> 00:11:46.970
Everything is as he wishes.

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:47.970
Fool...

00:11:50.810 --> 00:11:52.600
The time has come.

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:55.440
Please, show me your form!

00:12:28.060 --> 00:12:29.390
My lord...

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:33.390
This is quite the scene.

00:12:33.390 --> 00:12:35.520
Sinner Aion!

00:12:36.810 --> 00:12:41.070
I'm honored that you
remember my name, Jewel Witch.

00:12:41.070 --> 00:12:43.110
She's someone you know?

00:12:43.110 --> 00:12:46.280
Sort of. We go way back.

00:12:46.280 --> 00:12:49.200
I don't go back with
any devils! How disgusting!

00:12:50.240 --> 00:12:53.000
How dare someone in your
position speak with such impertinence?!

00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:54.790
How dare you...

00:12:55.710 --> 00:12:59.710
How dare someone like
you even speak his name?!

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:02.090
Know your place!

00:13:02.090 --> 00:13:03.300
That's enough.

00:13:06.340 --> 00:13:07.890
Lord Aion...

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:12.270
Please forgive me!

00:13:12.270 --> 00:13:14.310
I am sorry!

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:19.270
Although I did not know, I chose an
old acquaintance of yours as a sacrifice!

00:13:19.270 --> 00:13:24.490
You were trying to entertain me, right?

00:13:24.490 --> 00:13:26.860
Yes, of course.

00:13:26.860 --> 00:13:30.450
I've offered both my body
and my soul to you, Lord Aion.

00:13:31.790 --> 00:13:35.410
There hasn't been even a single day that
I haven't thought about you, Lord Aion.

00:13:46.630 --> 00:13:50.510
You've offered me
a rather interesting sacrifice today.

00:13:51.300 --> 00:13:53.560
You're a useful woman.

00:13:54.600 --> 00:13:56.980
Thank you.

00:14:02.900 --> 00:14:05.240
So you're the mastermind.

00:14:05.240 --> 00:14:07.900
And that's how
you manipulate that woman!

00:14:07.900 --> 00:14:11.830
Silence! I'll shut that
impolite mouth of yours!

00:14:11.830 --> 00:14:13.410
Now, no need to rush.

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:20.330
Before tasting a fine liqueur, one should
first gaze at its color, smell its bouquet,

00:14:20.330 --> 00:14:23.800
and feel its texture
to one's full satisfaction.

00:14:25.710 --> 00:14:29.970
Noble jewel witch, do you hate devils so?

00:14:29.970 --> 00:14:31.510
Of course!

00:14:31.510 --> 00:14:33.390
You have no problem
with stepping all over people,

00:14:33.390 --> 00:14:35.180
stealing whatever you can.

00:14:35.180 --> 00:14:38.560
I... I absolutely cannot forgive you!

00:14:39.230 --> 00:14:43.060
We've come this far, and yet you
can still say something like that.

00:14:43.060 --> 00:14:46.400
Is this the source of your self-confidence?

00:14:47.570 --> 00:14:51.620
This is the precious charm
that has protected you, right?

00:14:51.620 --> 00:14:53.740
A lovely scent!

00:14:54.530 --> 00:14:56.750
Don't touch it, you filth!

00:14:56.750 --> 00:14:58.210
That's a nice look.

00:14:58.210 --> 00:15:02.210
Even as you fight the feeling of despair,
you still believe in your own power.

00:15:02.210 --> 00:15:04.380
Lord Aion, we should do this soon.

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:08.300
That's right! Before I go,
let me tell you an old story.

00:15:09.300 --> 00:15:11.800
Long ago, in a country of black forests,

00:15:11.800 --> 00:15:14.430
there lived a family that
possessed fantastic power.

00:15:14.430 --> 00:15:16.560
Jewel summoners,
who could draw forth beasts

00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:19.600
from the magical power
secreted away in jewels.

00:15:20.560 --> 00:15:23.520
But they were wiped out all too easily.

00:15:24.360 --> 00:15:29.490
Attacked by a lone devil,
there was nothing they could do.

00:15:29.490 --> 00:15:33.450
But among them,
there was a single survivor.

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:38.370
A young girl was left behind, evading
death because of that devil's whimsy.

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:45.670
You've grown beautiful,
haven't you, Satella Harvenheit?

00:15:58.680 --> 00:16:00.060
What in the world is this?

00:16:00.060 --> 00:16:01.140
Legion.

00:16:01.140 --> 00:16:03.440
Legion? Why are there so many?

00:16:03.440 --> 00:16:07.730
They're being drawn here.
To the great power inside here...

00:16:08.940 --> 00:16:10.240
This feeling...

00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:13.530
W-What is this?!

00:16:16.910 --> 00:16:18.120
Look out!

00:16:27.090 --> 00:16:29.340
It's dangerous here!
Please get away quickly!

00:16:29.340 --> 00:16:31.260
What's going on?

00:16:31.260 --> 00:16:34.680
I know that we requested
that she exterminate the devils,

00:16:34.680 --> 00:16:37.390
but where did that woman go?!

00:16:44.770 --> 00:16:47.110
The fact that you scream hasn't changed.

00:16:47.110 --> 00:16:50.360
You're the one! You're the one!

00:16:50.360 --> 00:16:52.780
My family! My older sister!

00:16:52.780 --> 00:16:56.160
I won't forgive you! I won't forgive you!

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:59.410
Then what will you do? Kill me?

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:03.710
That's right. You've lived this
long for your revenge after all.

00:17:13.630 --> 00:17:16.010
That's a nice face. It gives me a thrill.

00:17:16.010 --> 00:17:18.890
Lord Aion, let's quickly
deal with this rude woman.

00:17:20.140 --> 00:17:21.220
I'll kill you!

00:17:21.220 --> 00:17:24.140
You'll kill me, will you? How interesting.

00:17:24.140 --> 00:17:27.020
With no allies, and no jewels...

00:17:28.860 --> 00:17:32.440
What are you saying you
can do with your bare hands?

00:17:32.440 --> 00:17:35.150
I will definitely kill you!

00:17:35.150 --> 00:17:37.820
Your older sister is alive.

00:17:40.410 --> 00:17:44.040
You really are cute. So honest!

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:48.880
Lord Aion...

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:51.420
Stop... Please stop.

00:17:51.420 --> 00:17:54.590
No, get away from that woman!

00:17:55.670 --> 00:18:00.760
You filthy woman... Tricking Lord Aion...

00:18:00.760 --> 00:18:02.100
Die!

00:18:02.100 --> 00:18:03.220
Shut up,you.

00:18:06.310 --> 00:18:09.020
Good bye. Have pleasant dreams.

00:18:18.150 --> 00:18:21.740
Poor little Satella Harvenheit.

00:18:21.740 --> 00:18:23.950
You've worked so hard,
all alone, to come this far,

00:18:23.950 --> 00:18:26.660
yet this is as far as your power goes?

00:18:27.910 --> 00:18:30.040
Will you pray to God?

00:18:30.040 --> 00:18:33.210
Though He won't answer anyway.

00:18:33.420 --> 00:18:35.590
No!

00:18:38.470 --> 00:18:39.680
Stop right there!

00:18:40.930 --> 00:18:42.760
Get away from Satella!

00:18:43.510 --> 00:18:46.430
Oh, it's Mary of Magdalene, and her servant.

00:18:46.430 --> 00:18:50.230
That's too bad. The Apostle isn't with you?

00:18:50.230 --> 00:18:53.610
Unfortunately.
Things aren't going to go as you planned.

00:18:53.610 --> 00:18:55.070
What did you do to Satella?!

00:18:55.070 --> 00:18:59.450
We just talked about
old times. No, reminiscing, perhaps?

00:18:59.450 --> 00:19:03.410
About a time when a family
of jewel masters was destroyed.

00:19:03.410 --> 00:19:05.330
Aion! You...

00:19:05.330 --> 00:19:07.790
You killed Satella's family...

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:11.880
Next time, I'd like to talk
with you, Rosette Christopher.

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:12.670
Rosette!

00:19:12.670 --> 00:19:13.670
You're in my way!

00:19:16.590 --> 00:19:17.590
Chrono!

00:19:28.770 --> 00:19:31.730
I see. You'll shoot today.

00:19:31.730 --> 00:19:34.150
I'll let you hear my treasured Gospel.

00:19:34.150 --> 00:19:35.150
Amen!

00:19:41.740 --> 00:19:43.490
Well, isn't that just too bad?

00:19:44.240 --> 00:19:48.240
It looks like God's
voice doesn't reach devils.

00:19:48.240 --> 00:19:53.210
But I recognize your courage.
At any rate, we'll meet again.

00:19:53.210 --> 00:19:54.540
Soon...

00:20:04.050 --> 00:20:05.720
I couldn't do anything.

00:20:06.970 --> 00:20:10.310
What was everything until now for?

00:20:10.310 --> 00:20:11.600
Satella...

00:20:14.690 --> 00:20:15.940
I'm sorry.

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:40.510
Did you take care of that collaborator?

00:20:40.510 --> 00:20:43.930
Yeah, it was quite amusing.

00:20:43.930 --> 00:20:46.720
It's almost time. Let's go.

00:20:46.720 --> 00:20:52.770
Yeah, let's teach those idiots
from Pandemonium what our power is.

00:20:54.690 --> 00:20:59.110
So you'll ally, not just with humans,
but even with the pursuers, Chrono?

00:20:59.110 --> 00:21:03.950
I'm looking forward to
seeing how far you'll go.
